# save: 18-DeptStore
# Fourside Department Store: in through the front door, 1F escalator up (arriving on 2F crosses
# hotspot 11, which arms hotspot 10), 2F escalator down, walk right across hotspot 10 on 1F: the
# blackout, the announcement and Paula kidnapped, A tapped through the text
# The store's escalators lag the original every few frames (a pad change or an escalator end next
# to a lag frame lands a frame late there), so the emu runs overclocked
# overclock: max
# The door load: the first emu sample is part-way in (skip) and its fade-in ends a CPU-time frame
# later in the original (lag)
# skip: 54
# lag: 74
# the NMI that would take the door fade-in's first step ran during the load, before the FADE_IN
# call, so the original's fade-in ends a logic frame later (wall-clock noise)
# ignore: idle 84
flag 11 1; teleport 3588 4323 0; wait 10; until idle 300
